      "summary": "The product list narrows a large catalog while preserving the context of the selected record.",
      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Product read permission is required.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Open the products screen in Catalog. Filters are displayed next to the table.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Enter the required criteria, apply the filter, then use table sorting or pagination. Select a row to open product-specific information.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>The table displays a server-side page matching the criteria, while the count and selection apply to the complete result set.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>“Select all” means every result of the current filter, not only the visible page.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>Selected products can be changed with <a href=\"/catalog/documentation/products-bulk-edit\">Bulk editing</a>.</p>\n",
