      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Permission for the relevant product change and product list access are required.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Select at least one record on the product list and choose the name or price action from the action toolbar.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Check the selection scope, enter the new value in the operation dialog, and confirm. Track progress in the tasks panel.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>Every product is processed separately. The tasks panel shows successes and errors, and the list refreshes changed records.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>Partial success is valid: an error on one product does not roll back changes saved for other products.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>See <a href=\"/catalog/documentation/background-jobs\">Background jobs</a> and <a href=\"/catalog/documentation/products-list-and-filters\">List and filters</a>.</p>\n",
