      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Catalog dictionary read permission is required. Deleting files and generating derivatives require separate permissions shown by the interface.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Choose Media library from the Catalog menu.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Find an asset, select one or more rows, then choose download, generate derivatives, or delete.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>Downloads save originals through the browser. Derivative generation and deletion create a task with visible progress.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>A file referenced by a product cannot be deleted. Detach it from every product first. External addresses are not files in system storage.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>For asynchronous operations, see <a href=\"/catalog/documentation/background-jobs\">Background jobs</a>.</p>\n",
